# A Consumer reads the named size_t field xFirst. The candidate puts an int
# there, while its unrelated size_t fields cannot satisfy that use. Admission
# fails at the call site, not during name resolution.
Pair: (size_t: xFirst 10U; size_t: xLast 20U)
Tri: (int: xFirst 7; size_t: xMiddle 20U; size_t: xLast 30U)
fn: firstToo (Pair: v) int
    size_t: got
    got: v\xFirst
    return: (cast: (int) (got))
end: firstToo
t: merge: Tri
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: firstToo(t); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
